+      },
+      {
+        "id": "work_01",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "work"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Rentals pay the light bill. Art pays the soul. Horace pays for everything else and reminds me weekly."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "work_02",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "work"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "We had a commercial crew in last month. Lovely people. Shot a yogurt like it was the Holy Grail. I learned things."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "work_03",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "work"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "The trick to running a studio is to look busy when the bank calls and look calm when the actors do."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "work_04",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "work"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Every good thing ever made on this lot was made by somebody who should have quit three weeks earlier."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "work_05",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "work"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Money comes and goes, dear boy. Mostly goes. The work is what stays."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "work_06",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "work"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "A day job isn't a betrayal of your art. It's the patron your art can't afford to thank."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "work_07",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "work"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "I've been broke in four decades and two accents. You learn to dress for the fifth."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "work_08",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "work"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Never take a job you can't describe at a dinner party. Unless it pays very well. Then describe it vaguely."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "work_09",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "work"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "When another studio rents our stage, I give them the tour. Free of charge. They never ask for it. They get it anyway."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "work_10",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "work"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "The secret of this business: say yes, then find out how."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "work_11",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "work"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Clients want three things: fast, cheap and good. I tell them to pick two and then I give them all three out of spite."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "work_12",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "work"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Budget is just the shape of the box you're about to think outside of."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x01",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "There's a cut in Lawrence of Arabia, a match blown out and then the desert sun. I've seen it a hundred times and I still hold my breath."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x02",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Old pictures had patience. They let a face sit there and think. Nobody lets a face think anymore."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x03",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Every great film is about a person who wants something badly and a world that would rather they didn't."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x04",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "The best special effect ever invented is a close-up of someone who means it."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x05",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "I saw my first picture in a theatre with a hole in the roof. Rained right through the love scene. Best love scene I ever saw."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x06",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Film is the only art form where you can make a mistake, sleep on it, and cut it out in the morning."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x07",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Comedy is drama that ran out of patience. Drama is comedy that forgot to laugh."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x08",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "A good director is invisible. A great director is invisible and blamed for everything."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x09",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "They say never meet your heroes. I met most of mine. Several of them owe me money."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x10",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Silent pictures had no dialogue and lost nothing. Think about that the next time a scene won't stop talking."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x11",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Black and white isn't the absence of colour. It's a decision."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x12",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Every film is three films: the one you wrote, the one you shot and the one you cut. The audience only sees the last one, and that's the only one that's true."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x13",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Musicals are just people too happy to keep talking. I respect that."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x14",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Westerns taught me everything about framing. Big sky, small man, long silence."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x15",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Hitchcock said drama is life with the dull bits cut out. He never ran a studio. The dull bits are where the rent comes from."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "film_x16",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "old_movies"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "A horror film is a comedy where the punchline bites."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "pod_01",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "podcast"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "Get close to the mic. A fist's width. Closer for secrets, further for shouting, and never ever eat crisps on air."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "pod_02",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "podcast"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "A good podcast is two people who'd talk anyway, plus a reason for you to listen."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "pod_03",
+        "kind": "beat",
+        "topics": [
+          "podcast"
+        ],
+        "moods": [
+          "neutral",
+          "celebrate",
+          "setback"
+        ],
+        "text": "The first minute is the whole audition. Open your intro with the most interesting thing you've got, not with hello."
